---
---
<section id="gym-health" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 via-emerald-50/20 to-slate-50 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Decorative background subtle glow -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-emerald-200/20 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100/80 border border-emerald-300/60 text-brand-emerald text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider shadow-sm">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-emerald">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.362 5.214A8.252 8.252 0 0112 21 8.25 8.25 0 016.038 7.048 8.287 8.287 0 009 9.6a8.983 8.983 0 013.361-6.867 8.21 8.21 0 003 2.48z" />
        </svg>
        NILAI PLUS UTAMA UNTUK CAFE & RESTO
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-brand-obsidian tracking-tight">
        Magnet Pelanggan Gym, Fitness & Healthy Lifestyle
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Jadikan tempat Anda pilihan utama komunitas sehat. Dengan <span class="font-bold text-brand-emerald">Custom RAG AI</span>, pelanggan dapat langsung bertanya jumlah kalori, protein, dan makronutrisi dari data yang Anda unggah secara transparan.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Feature Showcase Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Key Value Proposition Points -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
        
        <!-- Card 1: Macro Transparency -->
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-brand-emerald border border-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.362 5.214A8.252 8.252 0 0112 21 8.25 8.25 0 016.038 7.048 8.287 8.287 0 009 9.6a8.983 8.983 0 013.361-6.867 8.21 8.21 0 003 2.48z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-obsidian">Transparansi Kalori & Protein Real-Time</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Pelanggan gym tidak perlu repot mengira-ngira kalori. AI ServePoint menghitung protein, karbohidrat, dan lemak secara akurat berdasarkan resep asli resto Anda.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2: Custom RAG Upload -->
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-brand-amber border border-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0113.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375H8.25m6.75 12l-3-3m0 0l-3 3m3-3v6m-1.5-15H5.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 00-9-9z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-obsidian">Custom RAG: Admin Tinggal Upload File</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Cukup upload file Excel/PDF menu, takaran gizi, dan aturan jawaban khusus. AI langsung mempelajari data resto Anda tanpa koding sama sekali.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3: Custom Recommendation & Goal Matching -->
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-50 text-purple-600 border border-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09zM18.259 8.715L18 9.75l-.259-1.035a3.375 3.375 0 00-2.455-2.456L14.25 6l1.036-.259a3.375 3.375 0 002.455-2.456L18 2.25l.259 1.035a3.375 3.375 0 002.456 2.456L21.75 6l-1.035.259a3.375 3.375 0 00-2.456 2.456z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-obsidian">Rekomendasi Menu Sesuai Target Fitness</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              Apakah pelanggan Anda sedang <i>Bulking</i>, <i>Cutting</i>, Keto, atau Defisit Kalori? AI memberikan saran kombinasi menu dan penyesuaian porsi secara otomatis.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Interactive Voice & Macro UI Mockup Card -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 text-white shadow-2xl border border-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden">
        
        <!-- Top Status Bar -->
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-6 border-b border-slate-800">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">AI Assistant Meja 05 (Custom RAG Active)</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700">RAG-DATASET-V2.1</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Simulated Voice Dialogue -->
        <div class="my-6 space-y-4">
          <!-- Customer Question -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="h-7 w-7 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 border border-emerald-500/40 text-emerald-400 font-extrabold text-[10px] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">GYM</div>
            <div class="bg-slate-800 p-3.5 rounded-2xl rounded-tl-none border border-slate-700 text-xs text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-medium">
              "Mbak AI, saya habis leg day nih. Minta rekomendasi menu <span class="text-emerald-300 font-bold">tinggi protein (>35g)</span> tapi <span class="text-amber-300 font-bold">kalori di bawah 550 kcal</span> dong!"
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- AI Response based on Custom RAG -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="h-7 w-7 rounded-full bg-brand-emerald text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-[10px] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">AI</div>
            <div class="bg-emerald-950/60 p-4 rounded-2xl rounded-tl-none border border-emerald-800/80 text-xs text-emerald-100 space-y-3">
              <p class="leading-relaxed">
                "Siap Bro! Berdasarkan data nutrisi resmi resto kami, menu paling pas untuk paska-workout Anda adalah:
              </p>
              
              <!-- Dish Macro Preview Card -->
              <div class="bg-slate-900/90 rounded-xl p-3 border border-emerald-700/50 space-y-2">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                  <span class="font-extrabold text-sm text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21a9 9 0 100-18 9 9 0 000 18z" />
                    </svg>
                    Grilled Salmon Grain Bowl
                  </span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400">Rp 68.000</span>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Macro Pills -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 pt-1 text-center font-mono text-[10px]">
                  <div class="bg-emerald-900/50 p-1.5 rounded border border-emerald-700/40">
                    <div class="text-slate-400 text-[8px] uppercase">Protein</div>
                    <div class="text-emerald-300 font-bold text-xs">42g</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-amber-900/50 p-1.5 rounded border border-amber-700/40">
                    <div class="text-slate-400 text-[8px] uppercase">Kalori</div>
                    <div class="text-amber-300 font-bold text-xs">480 kcal</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-blue-900/50 p-1.5 rounded border border-blue-700/40">
                    <div class="text-slate-400 text-[8px] uppercase">Karbo</div>
                    <div class="text-blue-300 font-bold text-xs">38g</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-purple-900/50 p-1.5 rounded border border-purple-700/40">
                    <div class="text-slate-400 text-[8px] uppercase">Lemak</div>
                    <div class="text-purple-300 font-bold text-xs">14g</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-emerald-300/90 font-medium italic pt-1 flex items-center gap-1">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400 shrink-0">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18v-5.25m0 0a6.01 6.01 0 001.5-.189m-1.5.189a6.01 6.01 0 01-1.5-.189m3.75 7.478a12.06 12.06 0 01-4.5 0m3.75 2.383a14.406 14.406 0 01-3 0M14.25 18v-.192c0-.983.658-1.823 1.508-2.316a7.5 7.5 0 10-7.516 0c.85.493 1.508 1.333 1.508 2.316V18" />
                  </svg>
                  Tips Admin: Request dressing Olive Oil terpisah dapat menghemat 80 kcal tambahan.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Admin Customization Footer Strip -->
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-400">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
            Flow Jawaban Admin Resto Terverifikasi
          </span>
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold hover:underline cursor-pointer">Fitur Custom RAG Admin &rarr;</span>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
